{"summary":"Cut, grill, boil & pound monsters into gourmet dishes! Pixel cooking action!","description":"A restaurant like no other\n\nOn the edge of a ruined world stands a slightly quirky restaurant.\nCut. Grill. Boil. Salt. Pound. \nEvery step is a satisfying, high-tempo tap!\n\nTurn bizarre monsters and even microwaves into delicious masterpieces in this unique cooking action game.\n\nWhat's great about Catastrophe Restaurant?\n\n【1】Simple One-Tap Cooking Action\nTap at the perfect moment to prep ingredients. Easy to pick up, incredibly addictive.\nDevelop secret broths and upgrade your restaurant to master the chaos!\n\n【2】Wildly Weird Customers\nCyborgs, genius babies, mermaids, demons, and more. \nLaugh-out-loud conversations with your cheerful waitress \"Kuno\" and the mysterious \"Madam\" never stop.\n\n【3】A Surprisingly Gentle Apocalypse\nThe end of the world has never been this heartwarming.\nFunny, touching, and satisfying until the very end — a rare \"kindness in the ruins\" story.\n\nPlenty to enjoy\n・Develop over 100 secret broth recipes\n・Collect decorations to customize your restaurant\n・Discover the hidden stories of quirky guests\n・Upgrade tools and kitchen equipment\n\nPerfect for players who love:\n・Fast, satisfying tap action\n・Charming pixel art & retro style\n・Post-apocalyptic & dystopian worlds\n・Heartwarming humor and light stories\n・Games you can enjoy in short bursts\n\nNo in-app purchases needed to finish the game (ads are shown).\nWelcome to the friendliest restaurant at the end of the world!","esrbNotes":"Comic Mischief","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $37.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q90dQbX67DE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Fggg985ZgvMeX6G2E6E2mBBNQvm2-jtAa_7FudUurqMDWHIipAwVjP1stJgIF6M-tD7wx5uzXwgMRYaAKGiH4ss","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O20VBq130YpscND6SnLbK0RC0GzhKf82oiuxBkQs3SyV2rtTSsjC_Y7yn1AUZ9HEKmHuuFtnRlKIWD7XbUcm","